[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4982977927","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119852#issuecomment-4982977927","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119852","id":4982977927,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKQI1hw","user":{"login":"pkowal1982","id":19764492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzY0NDky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19764492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982","html_url":"https://github.com/pkowal1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkowal1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-15T16:33:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:33:30Z","body":"As we nailed down the problem to be just missing codec, I think\r\nwe can narrow the scope to only adding implementation of YUV420.\r\n\r\nI've gave the second thought to bytesperline handling. I think\r\nwe can skip it for now. All cameras I've been able to test\r\ndo not add extra padding. It's probably the result of typical\r\nresolutions which are multiplies of 16. Your test shows the same.\r\nAs camera support for Linux was added over a year ago and there\r\nwere no issues reported I think we can assume bytesperline always\r\nwill be multiple of width.\r\n\r\nI propose you remove bytesperline handling from this PR (for\r\nold code and also for YUV420), it will make it much smaller and\r\neasier to review. Then I'll make a review and we'll try to find\r\nsomeone from core team to give it some attention.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4982977927/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5825128331","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119852#issuecomment-5825128331","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119852","id":5825128331,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWzRniw","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T01:25:20Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T01:25:20Z","body":"I removed byteperline and rebased. Now only the addition of YUV420 remains.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5825128331/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"